%SRCG%L
%SRCG%Lsignal on syntax name caught
%SRCG%La = .array~of('old')
%SRCG%Lraise syntax 98.900 additional (a) return (mutate(a))
%SRCG%Lexit
%SRCG%Lcaught:
%SRCG%Lsay condition('o')~message
%SRCG%Lexit
%SRCG%Lmutate:
%SRCG%Luse arg a
%SRCG%La[1] = 'new'
%SRCG%Lreturn 1
